# Build output.
#
# The layout Obsidian expects: manifest.json, main.js and styles.css at the
# root of the repo. The manifest is the source of truth for the id and version
# so it stays tracked; main.js and styles.css are generated on every build and
# ship as assets on a GitHub release, which is where BRAT looks for them. A
# 3 MB bundle committed per version is not history worth keeping.
/main.js
/styles.css
